sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant G as FastAPI Gateway
    participant R as RSE (LangGraph)
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant F as FAISS Index
    participant L as LLM (OpenAI gpt-4.1-mini)

    rect rgb(255, 246, 234)
    Note over U,L: Recall — exactly 2 LLM calls per query
    U->>G: Natural-language question
    G->>R: Invoke graph
    R->>L: LLM call 1 · parse_intent
    L-->>R: Sources, time filter, clean query
    par Hybrid search
        R->>P: Keyword search (full-text)
    and
        R->>F: Semantic search
    end
    R->>R: RRF merge → quality gate (widen ≤ 3×) → cross-encoder rerank
    R->>L: LLM call 2 · synthesize (snippets only)
    L-->>R: Answer with citations
    R-->>U: Answer
    end
